  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CEAO WATER POINTS PROJECT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RURAL WATER POINTS WHICH WILL PROVIDE DRINKING WATER TO 52 VILLAGES IN REGIONS OF TAMBACOUNDA AND KOLDA IN EASTERN SENEGAL. IN ALL, 41 BORE HOLES ARE TO BE IMPLEMENTED AND 5 EXISTING ONES TO BE EQUIPPED WITH WATER SUPPLY SYSTEMS. 36 OF THE BORE HOLES WILL BE EQUIPPED WITH WATER PUMPS AND WATER STORAGE FACILITIES.</narrative>
  </description>
